{"id":"chatcmpl-767dfbb5-4d57-4157-a229-17029e9ac438","object":"chat.completion","created":1795248908,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"```json\n{\n  \"highlights\": \"This task demonstrates a multi-tool verification strategy for medical image interpretation, where an initial expert consultation is cross-validated with a grounded localization tool before committing to an answer. The pattern emphasizes using complementary diagnostic tools to confirm both the presence and the spatial location of a finding, reducing laterality errors. The final answer is only selected after both tools converge on the same conclusion.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"When a question requires distinguishing between two spatially distinct options (e.g., left vs. right), query a domain expert tool first to establish presence and laterality, then confirm with a localization/grounding tool.\",\n    \"Use complementary tools that answer the same question from different angles (diagnostic interpretation vs. spatial grounding) to cross-validate before finalizing an answer.\",\n    \"Structure tool queries to explicitly request the discriminating feature (location, laterality, supporting signs) rather than a generic yes/no, so the response directly resolves the answer options.\",\n    \"Defer the final answer until all tool outputs are consistent; cite convergence of multiple sources as the justification.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical imaging interpretation\": \"Ask an expert tool for presence plus location/supporting signs, then confirm with a grounded localization tool before answering laterality questions.\",\n    \"Binary choice with spatial discrimination\": \"Design queries that force the tool to specify the discriminating dimension (left/right, upper/lower) rather than just confirming the finding exists.\",\n    \"Multi-source verification\": \"Use at least two independent tools whose outputs can corroborate each other; treat agreement as the decision criterion.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm both tools agree on the finding's presence AND its laterality/location before selecting an option.\",\n    \"Verify the tool query explicitly asked for the discriminating feature (e.g., left vs. right) so the output maps cleanly to the answer choices.\"\n  ]\n}\n```"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":473,"total_tokens":871,"completion_tokens":398,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":473},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":398}}}